 "captions": [
  {
   "start": 2.0,
   "end": 4.4,
   "text": "Your body is a remarkable machine."
  },
  {
   "start": 4.4,
   "end": 6.9,
   "text": "Almost no one has ever explained it to you."
  },
  {
   "start": 6.9,
   "end": 8.4,
   "text": "Let's begin."
  },
  {
   "start": 8.5,
   "end": 12.8,
   "text": "On the floor, a push-up asks your arms to press about two thirds of your weight."
  },
  {
   "start": 12.8,
   "end": 16.4,
   "text": "For a heavy body, that is a heavy lift."
  },
  {
   "start": 16.9,
   "end": 19.4,
   "text": "So we begin at the wall."
  },
  {
   "start": 19.4,
   "end": 22.0,
   "text": "Stand an arm's length away."
  },
  {
   "start": 22.0,
   "end": 24.8,
   "text": "Hands flat, just below your shoulders."
  },
  {
   "start": 24.8,
   "end": 27.6,
   "text": "Keep one straight line from head to heel."
  },
  {
   "start": 27.6,
   "end": 34.9,
   "text": "Breathe in as you lean toward the wall.\nBreathe out as you press away."
  },
  {
   "start": 35.8,
   "end": 38.0,
   "text": "Watch what wakes up."
  },
  {
   "start": 38.0,
   "end": 41.0,
   "text": "The pectoralis major, across your chest."
  },
  {
   "start": 41.0,
   "end": 44.2,
   "text": "The front of the shoulder, the anterior deltoid."
  },
  {
   "start": 44.2,
   "end": 47.2,
   "text": "The triceps, along the back of the arm."
  },
  {
   "start": 47.2,
   "end": 51.8,
   "text": "And the serratus anterior, holding each shoulder blade flat against your ribs."
  },
  {
   "start": 52.2,
   "end": 55.6,
   "text": "As you press, they take the load."
  },
  {
   "start": 55.6,
   "end": 58.4,
   "text": "Your core holds the line,"
  },
  {
   "start": 58.4,
   "end": 63.4,
   "text": "so the effort travels from your hands to your feet, as one."
  },
  {
   "start": 65.9,
   "end": 67.9,
   "text": "Now closer."
  },
  {
   "start": 67.9,
   "end": 71.3,
   "text": "Inside each fibre, two proteins, actin and myosin,"
  },
  {
   "start": 71.3,
   "end": 74.3,
   "text": "grip and pull, again and again."
  },
  {
   "start": 74.3,
   "end": 77.5,
   "text": "Every pull spends a molecule called ATP."
  },
  {
   "start": 77.5,
   "end": 80.9,
   "text": "To make more, the muscle needs fuel."
  },
  {
   "start": 82.6,
   "end": 85.4,
   "text": "And here is something quiet and important."
  },
  {
   "start": 85.4,
   "end": 89.0,
   "text": "Working muscle can draw sugar out of your blood on its own,"
  },
  {
   "start": 89.0,
   "end": 91.2,
   "text": "without waiting for insulin."
  },
  {
   "start": 91.2,
   "end": 94.6,
   "text": "Every set clears a little sugar from your blood."
  },
  {
   "start": 96.0,
   "end": 98.6,
   "text": "The hardest part is not the muscle."
  },
  {
   "start": 98.6,
   "end": 100.6,
   "text": "It is tomorrow."
  },
  {
   "start": 100.6,
   "end": 105.2,
   "text": "In one study, new daily habits took a median of sixty-six days to feel automatic."
  },
  {
   "start": 105.2,
   "end": 107.2,
   "text": "Some took far longer."
  },
  {
   "start": 107.2,
   "end": 110.6,
   "text": "But missing a single day changed almost nothing."
  },
  {
   "start": 110.6,
   "end": 114.2,
   "text": "So if you miss one, simply come back."
  },
  {
   "start": 115.8,
   "end": 117.6,
   "text": "Here is this week."
  },
  {
   "start": 117.6,
   "end": 120.6,
   "text": "Two or three sets of five to ten wall push-ups."
  },
  {
   "start": 120.6,
   "end": 122.6,
   "text": "Rest a minute between sets."
  },
  {
   "start": 122.6,
   "end": 125.2,
   "text": "Three days, with a day off between."
  },
  {
   "start": 125.2,
   "end": 128.6,
   "text": "When fifteen feel easy, move your hands down to a counter."
  },
  {
   "start": 128.6,
   "end": 132.0,
   "text": "At your size, one set spends roughly five to ten calories."
  },
  {
   "start": 132.0,
   "end": 134.2,
   "text": "That is small, and that is honest."
  },
  {
   "start": 134.2,
   "end": 136.2,
   "text": "The push-up builds the machine."
  },
  {
   "start": 136.2,
   "end": 139.8,
   "text": "What you eat and drink, especially sugar, decides the weight."
  },
  {
   "start": 141.0,
   "end": 143.2,
   "text": "Your muscles are gold now."
  },
  {
   "start": 143.2,
   "end": 145.4,
   "text": "Recovering. Rebuilding."
  },
  {
   "start": 145.6,
   "end": 149.2,
   "text": "Small movements. Real changes. Until tomorrow.",
   "style": "signoff"
  }
 ],
